From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] rtl8188fu: include linux/timer.h

The timer helpers are not pulled in transitively on 7.x.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
--- a/include/osdep_service_linux.h	2026-11-02 08:18:23.408248206 -0500
+++ b/include/osdep_service_linux.h	2026-11-02 08:18:23.424321310 -0500
@@ -50,6 +50,7 @@
 #include <linux/if_arp.h>
 #include <linux/rtnetlink.h>
 #include <linux/delay.h>
+#include <linux/timer.h>
 #include <linux/interrupt.h>	/* for struct tasklet_struct */
 #include <linux/ip.h>
 #include <linux/kthread.h>
